// 블록 맵: 서버와 클라이언트가 같은 함수로 똑같은 맵을 만든다 (맵 데이터는 보내지 않음)
export const W = 48, D = 48, H = 10;
export const B = { AIR: 0, FLOOR: 1, WALL: 2, STONE: 3, CRATE: 4, COVER: 5 };

export const SPAWNS = [
  [4.5, 1, 4.5], [43.5, 1, 43.5], [4.5, 1, 43.5], [43.5, 1, 4.5], [24, 3, 24],
];

function rng(seed) {
  return () => {
    seed = (seed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;
    return seed / 4294967296;
  };
}

export function createMap() {
  const cells = new Uint8Array(W * D * H);
  const idx = (x, y, z) => x + W * (z + D * y);
  const inside = (x, y, z) => x >= 0 && x < W && z >= 0 && z < D && y >= 0 && y < H;
  const box = (x0, y0, z0, x1, y1, z1, b) => {
    for (let y = y0; y <= y1; y++)
      for (let z = z0; z <= z1; z++)
        for (let x = x0; x <= x1; x++)
          if (inside(x, y, z)) cells[idx(x, y, z)] = b;
  };

  // 바닥과 바깥 벽
  box(0, 0, 0, W - 1, 0, D - 1, B.FLOOR);
  box(0, 1, 0, W - 1, 4, 0, B.WALL);
  box(0, 1, D - 1, W - 1, 4, D - 1, B.WALL);
  box(0, 1, 0, 0, 4, D - 1, B.WALL);
  box(W - 1, 1, 0, W - 1, 4, D - 1, B.WALL);

  // 가운데 단상(높이 2)과 네 방향 계단
  box(20, 1, 20, 27, 2, 27, B.STONE);
  box(23, 1, 19, 24, 1, 19, B.STONE);
  box(23, 1, 28, 24, 1, 28, B.STONE);
  box(19, 1, 23, 19, 1, 24, B.STONE);
  box(28, 1, 23, 28, 1, 24, B.STONE);

  // 사분면마다 키 큰 벽(못 넘음)과 낮은 엄폐물(점프로 넘음)
  for (const [sx, sz] of [[1, 1], [-1, 1], [1, -1], [-1, -1]]) {
    const cx = sx > 0 ? 12 : 35, cz = sz > 0 ? 12 : 35;
    box(cx - 3, 1, cz, cx + 3, 3, cz, B.WALL);
    box(cx, 1, cz - 3, cx, 3, cz - 1, B.WALL);
    box(cx + 2 * sx, 1, cz + 3 * sz, cx + 4 * sx, 1, cz + 3 * sz, B.COVER);
  }
  // 중앙으로 가는 길목의 낮은 엄폐물
  box(16, 1, 23, 16, 1, 24, B.COVER);
  box(31, 1, 23, 31, 1, 24, B.COVER);
  box(23, 1, 16, 24, 1, 16, B.COVER);
  box(23, 1, 31, 24, 1, 31, B.COVER);

  // 상자 더미 (나중에 부술 수 있는 블록)
  const r = rng(20261030);
  let placed = 0;
  while (placed < 22) {
    const x = 3 + Math.floor(r() * 41), z = 3 + Math.floor(r() * 41);
    const tall = r() < 0.4 ? 2 : 1;
    if (x > 16 && x < 31 && z > 16 && z < 31) continue;
    if (SPAWNS.some(([sx, , sz]) => Math.hypot(sx - x, sz - z) < 6)) continue;
    let clear = true;
    for (let dz = -1; dz <= 2 && clear; dz++)
      for (let dx = -1; dx <= 2 && clear; dx++)
        if (cells[idx(x + dx, 1, z + dz)] !== B.AIR) clear = false;
    if (!clear) continue;
    box(x, 1, z, x + 1, tall, z + 1, B.CRATE);
    placed++;
  }

  return {
    cells,
    get: (x, y, z) => (inside(x, y, z) ? cells[idx(x, y, z)] : B.AIR),
    solid(x, y, z) {
      if (y < 0) return true;
      if (x < 0 || x >= W || z < 0 || z >= D) return true;
      if (y >= H) return false;
      return cells[idx(x, y, z)] !== B.AIR;
    },
  };
}

// 이동 물리: 서버(판정)와 클라이언트(예측)가 똑같이 돌려야 하므로 여기 한 곳에만 둔다
export const TICK = 1 / 60;
export const P = { hw: 0.3, h: 1.7, eye: 1.5, speed: 6, jump: 8, gravity: 24 };
export const KEY = { F: 1, B: 2, L: 4, R: 8, J: 16 };
const EPS = 1e-4;

export function newState([x, y, z]) {
  return { x, y, z, vx: 0, vy: 0, vz: 0, g: false };
}

function hits(map, x, y, z) {
  const x0 = Math.floor(x - P.hw + EPS), x1 = Math.floor(x + P.hw - EPS);
  const y0 = Math.floor(y + EPS), y1 = Math.floor(y + P.h - EPS);
  const z0 = Math.floor(z - P.hw + EPS), z1 = Math.floor(z + P.hw - EPS);
  for (let j = y0; j <= y1; j++)
    for (let k = z0; k <= z1; k++)
      for (let i = x0; i <= x1; i++)
        if (map.solid(i, j, k)) return true;
  return false;
}

// inp = { k: 키 비트, y: yaw }
export function stepPlayer(s, inp, map) {
  const k = inp.k, yaw = inp.y;
  const mz = (k & KEY.F ? 1 : 0) - (k & KEY.B ? 1 : 0);
  const mx = (k & KEY.R ? 1 : 0) - (k & KEY.L ? 1 : 0);
  let dx = -Math.sin(yaw) * mz + Math.cos(yaw) * mx;
  let dz = -Math.cos(yaw) * mz - Math.sin(yaw) * mx;
  const len = Math.hypot(dx, dz);
  if (len > 0) { dx /= len; dz /= len; }
  s.vx = dx * P.speed;
  s.vz = dz * P.speed;
  if (k & KEY.J && s.g) s.vy = P.jump;
  s.vy = Math.max(s.vy - P.gravity * TICK, -30);

  let nx = s.x + s.vx * TICK;
  if (hits(map, nx, s.y, s.z)) {
    nx = s.vx > 0 ? Math.floor(nx + P.hw) - P.hw - EPS * 2 : Math.floor(nx - P.hw) + 1 + P.hw + EPS * 2;
    if (hits(map, nx, s.y, s.z)) nx = s.x;
    s.vx = 0;
  }
  s.x = nx;

  let nz = s.z + s.vz * TICK;
  if (hits(map, s.x, s.y, nz)) {
    nz = s.vz > 0 ? Math.floor(nz + P.hw) - P.hw - EPS * 2 : Math.floor(nz - P.hw) + 1 + P.hw + EPS * 2;
    if (hits(map, s.x, s.y, nz)) nz = s.z;
    s.vz = 0;
  }
  s.z = nz;

  let ny = s.y + s.vy * TICK;
  s.g = false;
  if (hits(map, s.x, ny, s.z)) {
    if (s.vy < 0) { ny = Math.floor(ny) + 1; s.g = true; }
    else ny = Math.floor(ny + P.h) - P.h - EPS * 2;
    if (hits(map, s.x, ny, s.z)) ny = s.y;
    s.vy = 0;
  }
  s.y = ny;
}

// 게임 서버: 정적 파일 + WebSocket. 위치는 서버가 판정하고 클라이언트는 입력만 보낸다
import http from 'node:http';
import fs from 'node:fs';
import path from 'node:path';
import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';
import { WebSocketServer } from 'ws';
import { createMap, SPAWNS } from '../shared/map.js';
import { TICK, newState, stepPlayer } from '../shared/sim.js';

const PORT = Number(process.env.PORT) || 3000;
const ROOT = path.resolve(fileURLToPath(new URL('..', import.meta.url)));
const MAX_PLAYERS = 5;
const SNAPSHOT_EVERY = 3; // 60틱 중 3틱마다 = 초당 20번
const COLORS = ['#e8505b', '#3d8bfd', '#f2b632', '#2fbf71', '#a259ff'];

// ---- 정적 파일 ----
const ROUTES = [
  ['/vendor/', 'node_modules/three/build/'],
  ['/client/', 'client/'],
  ['/shared/', 'shared/'],
];
const MIME = { '.html': 'text/html; charset=utf-8', '.js': 'text/javascript; charset=utf-8', '.css': 'text/css; charset=utf-8' };

const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  let p;
  try { p = decodeURIComponent(new URL(req.url, 'http://x').pathname); } catch { p = ''; }
  if (p === '/') p = '/client/index.html';
  let file = null;
  for (const [prefix, dir] of ROUTES) {
    if (!p.startsWith(prefix)) continue;
    const base = path.join(ROOT, dir);
    const f = path.join(base, p.slice(prefix.length));
    if (f.startsWith(base)) file = f;
  }
  if (!file) { res.writeHead(404).end('not found'); return; }
  fs.readFile(file, (err, data) => {
    if (err) { res.writeHead(404).end('not found'); return; }
    res.writeHead(200, { 'Content-Type': MIME[path.extname(file)] || 'application/octet-stream' }).end(data);
  });
});

// ---- 방 ----
const map = createMap();
const rooms = new Map();
let nextId = 1;

function makeCode() {
  const letters = 'ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ';
  let code;
  do code = Array.from({ length: 4 }, () => letters[Math.floor(Math.random() * letters.length)]).join('');
  while (rooms.has(code));
  return code;
}

function send(ws, msg) {
  if (ws.readyState === ws.OPEN) ws.send(JSON.stringify(msg));
}

function broadcast(room, msg) {
  const data = JSON.stringify(msg);
  for (const p of room.players.values()) if (p.ws.readyState === p.ws.OPEN) p.ws.send(data);
}

function roster(room) {
  broadcast(room, {
    t: 'roster',
    players: [...room.players.values()].map((p) => ({ id: p.id, name: p.name, color: p.color })),
  });
}

function join(ws, msg) {
  const name = String(msg.name || '').trim().slice(0, 12) || '플레이어';
  let code = String(msg.room || '').trim().toUpperCase();
  let room;
  if (code) {
    room = rooms.get(code);
    if (!room) return send(ws, { t: 'error', msg: `방 ${code}을(를) 찾을 수 없습니다.` });
  } else {
    code = makeCode();
    room = { code, players: new Map() };
    rooms.set(code, room);
  }
  if (room.players.size >= MAX_PLAYERS) return send(ws, { t: 'error', msg: '방이 가득 찼습니다.' });

  const used = new Set([...room.players.values()].map((p) => p.slot));
  const slot = [...Array(MAX_PLAYERS).keys()].find((i) => !used.has(i));
  const p = {
    id: nextId++, ws, name, slot, color: COLORS[slot], room,
    state: newState(SPAWNS[slot]), queue: [], lastSeq: 0, yaw: 0, pitch: 0,
  };
  room.players.set(p.id, p);
  send(ws, { t: 'welcome', id: p.id, room: code, state: p.state });
  roster(room);
  return p;
}

function leave(p) {
  const room = p.room;
  room.players.delete(p.id);
  if (room.players.size === 0) rooms.delete(room.code);
  else roster(room);
}

const wss = new WebSocketServer({ server, maxPayload: 1024 });
wss.on('connection', (ws) => {
  let me = null;
  ws.on('message', (raw) => {
    let msg;
    try { msg = JSON.parse(raw); } catch { return; }
    if (msg.t === 'join' && !me) me = join(ws, msg) || null;
    else if (msg.t === 'ping') send(ws, { t: 'pong', c: msg.c });
    else if (msg.t === 'i' && me) {
      const k = msg.k | 0, s = msg.s | 0;
      if (k < 0 || k > 31 || s <= me.lastSeq || !Number.isFinite(msg.y) || !Number.isFinite(msg.p)) return;
      me.queue.push({ s, k, y: msg.y, p: msg.p });
      if (me.queue.length > 30) me.queue.shift();
    }
  });
  ws.on('close', () => { if (me) leave(me); });
});

// ---- 게임 루프 ----
let tick = 0;
setInterval(() => {
  tick++;
  for (const room of rooms.values()) {
    for (const p of room.players.values()) {
      // 한 틱에 최대 3개까지만 처리: 입력을 몰아 보내 빨리 움직이는 것 방지
      for (let n = 0; n < 3 && p.queue.length; n++) {
        const inp = p.queue.shift();
        stepPlayer(p.state, inp, map);
        p.lastSeq = inp.s;
        p.yaw = inp.y;
        p.pitch = inp.p;
      }
      if (p.state.y < -10) p.state = newState(SPAWNS[p.slot]);
    }
    if (tick % SNAPSHOT_EVERY === 0) {
      broadcast(room, {
        t: 's',
        ps: [...room.players.values()].map((p) => {
          const s = p.state;
          return [p.id, s.x, s.y, s.z, s.vx, s.vy, s.vz, s.g ? 1 : 0, p.yaw, p.pitch, p.lastSeq];
        }),
      });
    }
  }
}, TICK * 1000);

server.listen(PORT, () => console.log(`block-arena 서버: http://localhost:${PORT}`));

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: #8fc9f0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif; }
canvas { display: block; }

.overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(10, 20, 40, 0.45); z-index: 10; }
.hidden { display: none !important; }
.panel { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px 32px; min-width: 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #1d2b44; }
.panel h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 28px; color: #1d2b44; }
.panel label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 13px; color: #445; }
.panel input { font-size: 16px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 2px solid #cdd5e0; border-radius: 6px; }
.panel input:focus { outline: none; border-color: #3d8bfd; }
#room { text-transform: uppercase; }
.panel button { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: #3d8bfd; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #1f5fc4; }
.panel button:active { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #1f5fc4; }
#error { margin: 0; color: #d33; font-size: 14px; min-height: 1em; }
.big { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: #1d2b44; }
.hint { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #667; text-align: center; }

#hud { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); }
#info { position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 14px; font-size: 14px; }
#info b { font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
#players { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; }
#players li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 2px 0; }
#players i { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; display: inline-block; }
#ping { position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 14px; font-size: 13px; }
#crosshair { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 14px; height: 14px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }
#crosshair::before, #crosshair::after { content: ""; position: absolute; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 2px #000; }
#crosshair::before { left: 6px; top: 0; width: 2px; height: 14px; }
#crosshair::after { top: 6px; left: 0; width: 14px; height: 2px; }

import * as THREE from 'three';
import { createMap, W, D, H, B } from '/shared/map.js';
import { TICK, P, KEY, stepPlayer } from '/shared/sim.js';

const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
const map = createMap();

// ---- 화면 ----
const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true });
renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2));
renderer.setSize(innerWidth, innerHeight);
document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);

const scene = new THREE.Scene();
scene.background = new THREE.Color('#8fc9f0');
scene.fog = new THREE.Fog('#8fc9f0', 30, 75);
scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight('#ffffff', '#6b7a5a', 1.6));
const sun = new THREE.DirectionalLight('#ffffff', 1.4);
sun.position.set(30, 50, 15);
scene.add(sun);

const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(80, innerWidth / innerHeight, 0.05, 200);
camera.rotation.order = 'YXZ';
camera.position.set(W / 2, 12, D + 6);
camera.lookAt(W / 2, 0, D / 2);

addEventListener('resize', () => {
  renderer.setSize(innerWidth, innerHeight);
  camera.aspect = innerWidth / innerHeight;
  camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
});

// ---- 맵 그리기: 겉으로 드러난 블록만 InstancedMesh 하나로 ----
function blockTexture() {
  const c = document.createElement('canvas');
  c.width = c.height = 16;
  const g = c.getContext('2d');
  g.fillStyle = '#ffffff';
  g.fillRect(0, 0, 16, 16);
  g.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.18)';
  g.strokeRect(0.5, 0.5, 15, 15);
  const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(c);
  tex.magFilter = THREE.NearestFilter;
  tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;
  return tex;
}

const BLOCK_COLORS = {
  [B.FLOOR]: ['#6cbf5a', '#63b352'],
  [B.WALL]: ['#8a909b', '#828893'],
  [B.STONE]: ['#c9bfa8', '#beb49c'],
  [B.CRATE]: ['#c98a3e', '#bd8037'],
  [B.COVER]: ['#5b7fbf', '#5377b5'],
};

function buildWorld() {
  const list = [];
  for (let y = 0; y < H; y++)
    for (let z = 0; z < D; z++)
      for (let x = 0; x < W; x++) {
        const b = map.get(x, y, z);
        if (!b) continue;
        const exposed = !map.solid(x + 1, y, z) || !map.solid(x - 1, y, z) || !map.solid(x, y + 1, z)
          || (y > 0 && !map.solid(x, y - 1, z)) || !map.solid(x, y, z + 1) || !map.solid(x, y, z - 1);
        if (exposed) list.push([x, y, z, b]);
      }
  const mesh = new THREE.InstancedMesh(
    new THREE.BoxGeometry(1, 1, 1),
    new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({ map: blockTexture() }),
    list.length,
  );
  const m = new THREE.Matrix4(), col = new THREE.Color();
  list.forEach(([x, y, z, b], i) => {
    m.setPosition(x + 0.5, y + 0.5, z + 0.5);
    mesh.setMatrixAt(i, m);
    mesh.setColorAt(i, col.set(BLOCK_COLORS[b][(x + y + z) & 1]));
  });
  scene.add(mesh);
}
buildWorld();

// ---- 다른 플레이어 아바타 ----
function part(w, h, d, color, x, y, z) {
  const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w, h, d), new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({ color }));
  mesh.position.set(x, y, z);
  return mesh;
}

function nameTag(text) {
  const c = document.createElement('canvas');
  c.width = 256; c.height = 64;
  const g = c.getContext('2d');
  g.font = 'bold 34px system-ui, sans-serif';
  g.textAlign = 'center';
  g.textBaseline = 'middle';
  g.lineWidth = 6;
  g.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.6)';
  g.strokeText(text, 128, 32);
  g.fillStyle = '#fff';
  g.fillText(text, 128, 32);
  const sprite = new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({ map: new THREE.CanvasTexture(c), depthTest: false }));
  sprite.scale.set(1.6, 0.4, 1);
  sprite.position.y = 2.15;
  return sprite;
}

// 팔다리는 관절(pivot) 그룹 안에 넣어 흔들기
function limb(w, h, color, x, y) {
  const pivot = new THREE.Group();
  pivot.position.set(x, y, 0);
  pivot.add(part(w, h, w, color, 0, -h / 2, 0));
  return pivot;
}

function makeAvatar(name, color) {
  const root = new THREE.Group();
  const skin = '#f2d0a4', pants = '#2d3550';
  const legL = limb(0.27, 0.7, pants, -0.15, 0.7), legR = limb(0.27, 0.7, pants, 0.15, 0.7);
  const armL = limb(0.22, 0.65, color, -0.42, 1.38), armR = limb(0.22, 0.65, color, 0.42, 1.38);
  const torso = part(0.6, 0.68, 0.32, color, 0, 1.05, 0);
  const head = new THREE.Group();
  head.position.y = 1.39;
  head.add(part(0.46, 0.46, 0.46, skin, 0, 0.24, 0));
  head.add(part(0.07, 0.1, 0.02, '#1d1d1d', -0.1, 0.28, -0.235));
  head.add(part(0.07, 0.1, 0.02, '#1d1d1d', 0.1, 0.28, -0.235));
  root.add(legL, legR, armL, armR, torso, head, nameTag(name));
  scene.add(root);
  return { root, head, legL, legR, armL, armR, phase: 0, buf: [] };
}

// ---- 입력 ----
const keys = new Set();
let yaw = 0, pitch = 0;
const SENS = 0.0022;
const locked = () => document.pointerLockElement === renderer.domElement;

addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (locked()) { keys.add(e.code); if (e.code === 'Space') e.preventDefault(); } });
addEventListener('keyup', (e) => keys.delete(e.code));
addEventListener('blur', () => keys.clear());
addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
  if (!locked()) return;
  yaw -= e.movementX * SENS;
  pitch = Math.max(-1.55, Math.min(1.55, pitch - e.movementY * SENS));
});
document.addEventListener('pointerlockchange', () => {
  if (!locked()) keys.clear();
  if (joined) $('resume').classList.toggle('hidden', locked());
});
$('resume').addEventListener('click', () => renderer.domElement.requestPointerLock());

function keyBits() {
  let k = 0;
  if (keys.has('KeyW')) k |= KEY.F;
  if (keys.has('KeyS')) k |= KEY.B;
  if (keys.has('KeyA')) k |= KEY.L;
  if (keys.has('KeyD')) k |= KEY.R;
  if (keys.has('Space')) k |= KEY.J;
  return k;
}

// ---- 네트워크 ----
let ws = null, joined = false, myId = 0;
let me = null, prev = null, seq = 0, pending = [];
const others = new Map(); // id -> avatar
const INTERP_MS = 100;

$('name').value = localStorageGet('name');
$('join').addEventListener('click', connect);
for (const id of ['name', 'room']) $(id).addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Enter') connect(); });

function localStorageGet(k) { try { return localStorage.getItem(k) || ''; } catch { return ''; } }
function localStorageSet(k, v) { try { localStorage.setItem(k, v); } catch {} }

function connect() {
  if (ws) return;
  $('error').textContent = '';
  const name = $('name').value.trim();
  localStorageSet('name', name);
  ws = new WebSocket(`${location.protocol === 'https:' ? 'wss' : 'ws'}://${location.host}`);
  ws.onopen = () => ws.send(JSON.stringify({ t: 'join', name, room: $('room').value.trim() }));
  ws.onmessage = (e) => onMessage(JSON.parse(e.data));
  ws.onclose = () => {
    const wasJoined = joined;
    ws = null; joined = false;
    for (const a of others.values()) scene.remove(a.root);
    others.clear();
    $('hud').classList.add('hidden');
    $('resume').classList.add('hidden');
    $('lobby').classList.remove('hidden');
    if (wasJoined) $('error').textContent = '서버와 연결이 끊겼습니다.';
    else if (!$('error').textContent) $('error').textContent = '서버에 연결할 수 없습니다.';
  };
}

function onMessage(msg) {
  if (msg.t === 'error') {
    $('error').textContent = msg.msg;
    ws.close();
  } else if (msg.t === 'welcome') {
    joined = true;
    myId = msg.id;
    me = { ...msg.state };
    prev = { ...me };
    seq = 0; pending = [];
    $('code').textContent = msg.room;
    $('lobby').classList.add('hidden');
    $('hud').classList.remove('hidden');
    $('resume').classList.remove('hidden');
    renderer.domElement.requestPointerLock();
  } else if (msg.t === 'roster') {
    const ids = new Set();
    $('players').innerHTML = '';
    for (const p of msg.players) {
      ids.add(p.id);
      const li = document.createElement('li');
      li.innerHTML = '<i></i><span></span>';
      li.querySelector('i').style.background = p.color;
      li.querySelector('span').textContent = p.name + (p.id === myId ? ' (나)' : '');
      $('players').append(li);
      if (p.id !== myId && !others.has(p.id)) others.set(p.id, makeAvatar(p.name, p.color));
    }
    for (const [id, a] of others) if (!ids.has(id)) { scene.remove(a.root); others.delete(id); }
  } else if (msg.t === 's') {
    const now = performance.now();
    for (const [id, x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, g, pyaw, ppitch, last] of msg.ps) {
      if (id === myId) {
        // 서버 위치로 맞춘 뒤, 서버가 아직 처리 안 한 입력을 다시 적용 (예측 보정)
        me = { x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, g: !!g };
        pending = pending.filter((inp) => inp.s > last);
        for (const inp of pending) stepPlayer(me, inp, map);
      } else {
        const a = others.get(id);
        if (!a) continue;
        a.buf.push({ t: now, x, y, z, yaw: pyaw, pitch: ppitch });
        if (a.buf.length > 20) a.buf.shift();
      }
    }
  } else if (msg.t === 'pong') {
    $('ping').textContent = `${Math.round(performance.now() - msg.c)} ms`;
  }
}

setInterval(() => { if (joined) ws.send(JSON.stringify({ t: 'ping', c: performance.now() })); }, 2000);

// ---- 다른 플레이어 보간 (100ms 뒤를 그려서 끊김 없이) ----
const lerp = (a, b, t) => a + (b - a) * t;
function lerpAngle(a, b, t) {
  let d = b - a;
  while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;
  while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;
  return a + d * t;
}

function updateOthers(now, dt) {
  const t = now - INTERP_MS;
  for (const a of others.values()) {
    const buf = a.buf;
    if (!buf.length) { a.root.visible = false; continue; }
    a.root.visible = true;
    let s0 = buf[0], s1 = buf[0];
    for (let i = 0; i < buf.length - 1; i++)
      if (buf[i].t <= t && buf[i + 1].t >= t) { s0 = buf[i]; s1 = buf[i + 1]; break; }
    if (t > buf[buf.length - 1].t) s0 = s1 = buf[buf.length - 1];
    const f = s1.t > s0.t ? (t - s0.t) / (s1.t - s0.t) : 0;
    const x = lerp(s0.x, s1.x, f), z = lerp(s0.z, s1.z, f);
    const speed = Math.hypot(x - a.root.position.x, z - a.root.position.z) / Math.max(dt, 1e-3);
    a.root.position.set(x, lerp(s0.y, s1.y, f), z);
    a.root.rotation.y = lerpAngle(s0.yaw, s1.yaw, f);
    a.head.rotation.x = lerp(s0.pitch, s1.pitch, f) * 0.6;
    // 걷기 동작
    const amt = Math.min(1, speed / P.speed);
    a.phase += dt * 10 * amt;
    const swing = Math.sin(a.phase) * 0.7 * amt;
    a.legL.rotation.x = swing; a.legR.rotation.x = -swing;
    a.armL.rotation.x = -swing; a.armR.rotation.x = swing;
  }
}

// ---- 메인 루프: 60틱 고정 시뮬레이션 + 화면은 보간 ----
let acc = 0, last = performance.now();
function frame(now) {
  const dt = Math.min(0.25, (now - last) / 1000);
  last = now;
  if (joined) {
    acc += dt;
    while (acc >= TICK) {
      acc -= TICK;
      prev = { ...me };
      const inp = { s: ++seq, k: keyBits(), y: yaw, p: pitch };
      stepPlayer(me, inp, map);
      pending.push(inp);
      if (pending.length > 120) pending.shift();
      ws.send(JSON.stringify({ t: 'i', ...inp }));
    }
    const a = acc / TICK;
    camera.position.set(lerp(prev.x, me.x, a), lerp(prev.y, me.y, a) + P.eye, lerp(prev.z, me.z, a));
    camera.rotation.set(pitch, yaw, 0);
    updateOthers(now, dt);
  }
  renderer.render(scene, camera);
  requestAnimationFrame(frame);
}
requestAnimationFrame(frame);

